      "tools": "C++, Python, Django, YOLOv8, ESP32-CAM, React.js, MySQL, FastAPI, RFID",
      "image_url": "/media/projects/baraqa_bin.png",
      "link": "",
      "order": 4,
      "bullets": [
        {
          "id": 56,
          "text": "Bangladesh's waste crisis is not a knowledge problem \u2014 it is a habit problem. We decided to solve it from the very root: childhood.",
          "order": 0
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "text": "If a child learns to dispose waste correctly from an early age, that behavior stays for life. When an entire generation grows up with this habit, Bangladesh will not need enforcement \u2014 cleanliness will simply become their nature.",
          "order": 1
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "text": "BARAQA_BIN makes this possible. Students earn reward points every time they use the correct bin. A live leaderboard creates healthy daily competition.",
          "order": 2
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "text": "Achievement badges like \"Eco Warrior\" celebrate consistency. Monthly rewards include canteen discounts and tuition fee waivers \u2014 making responsible behavior genuinely worthwhile.",
          "order": 3
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "text": "We collaborate with schools to make this a natural daily routine \u2014 not an extra activity. One habit. One generation. One clean Bangladesh.",
          "order": 4
        }
      ]
    }
